        "It is a vital biological corridor for the northernmost population of wild jaguars in the Americas.",
        "The region is rich in mineral resources, particularly copper, which is mined on a large scale in Cananea.",
        "The mountains serve as the primary source for the Yaqui and Sonora rivers.",
